# =============================================================================
# BERMUDA Stealth Gateway NG — Fail-Closed Docker Build Boundary
#
# Architectural Security Mandate:
# 1. Default-Deny: Everything is blocked from the Docker build context by default.
# 2. Strict Zero-Leakage: index.html (client cockpit) and client tools NEVER enter.
# 3. Zero-Credential Image: config.json is excluded to prevent credentials from
#    being baked into immutable Docker image layers or Git history.
# =============================================================================

# 1. Block everything in the workspace
**

# 2. Whitelist ONLY the exact root-level production inputs required for building
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!go.mod
!*.go
!railway.json
